// What each class's trainer teaches, from the client's own tables: a class's skill lines (SkillLine), the
// spells a trainer teaches on them (SkillLineAbility), the level each is learned at (SpellLevels) and its rank
// (Spell). A spell learned by itself, a talent's own ranks and a spell learned at level 0 are left out; prices
// are the server's alone. Generated by `lunatype generate trainable`: never edited by hand. Source: wago.tools,
// product wowf, build 1.60.1.71037.

// A skill line's name in the two languages.
